Key improvements made:

1. Added proper spacing - Using gap-3 class creates consistent spacing between all elements
2. Visual separators - Added vertical rules (<div class="vr"></div>) to visually separate different control groups
3. Better visual hierarchy - The info text now has its own container with proper padding
4. Responsive wrapping - Using flex-wrap ensures elements stack nicely on mobile
5. Improved styling - The info text now appears in a badge/pill for better visibility
6. Clear visual grouping - Each control group is visually distinct

The main issue was that the info text was directly adjacent to the buttons without any margin/padding. Adding the gap-3 class and proper container structure creates the necessary breathing room between elements.
